# A page that composes a name off a job that calls nothing

The `call / build` check is a real composed name and is left here so this fixture
trips one rule and not two.

The line below is the near miss. `Pull request hygiene` is a job this tree
declares and it runs steps of its own, so it reports one context and never one
with a slash in it.

- The `Pull request hygiene / build` check required on the release branches.
